  description: 'If a Level 10 EARTH Machine monster(s) is Normal or Special Summoned
    to your field (except during the Damage Step): You can activate this effect;
    your opponent takes no battle damage for the rest of this turn (even if this
    card leaves the field), also you Special Summon 1 Level 4 EARTH Machine monster
    with 1800 or more ATK from your Deck, and if you do, it becomes Level 10. You
    can send 1 card from your hand to the GY; add 1 Level 10 EARTH Machine monster
    from your Deck to your hand. You can only use 1 "Revolving Switchyard" effect
    per turn, and only once that turn.'
